    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls:
    - index: 0
      functionType: 1
      parameter:
      - MainInteract1
  - text: Don't you want to go with them?
    displayText: Don't you want to go with them?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: No. $$Trying to create a good drawing is hard enough.
    displayText: No. Trying to create a good drawing is hard enough.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0400000004000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: .$.$.Really? You don't want to play with others even a bit?
    displayText: ...Really? You don't want to play with others even a bit?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e7de67e2d95a03d4b82bb6e2e759966a, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0100000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Maybe I'll like it if I get to play with them. $$But my parents never really
      introduce me to them, $$so.$.$. I don't know.
    displayText: Maybe I'll like it if I get to play with them. But my parents never
      really introduce me to them, so... I don't know.
